.gitignore Banane ke Steps (VS Code me)File Create Karein:VS Code ke File Explorer me jayein.Apne project ke root folder (project13_fullstack) me ek new file create karein.   File ka naam theek .gitignore rakhein (aage dot . lagana compulsory hai, iska koi extension jaise .txt nahi hota).Content Paste Karein:
File khol kar Django aur React dono ke zaroori ignore rules likhein:Plaintext# Python & Django Cache
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.sqlite3

# Virtual Environments
venv/
env/
ENV/

# React / Node Dependencies & Build
node_modules/
frontend/node_modules/
dist/
frontend/dist/
build/
